<title>USA: J.C. Penney Sept same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney Sept same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $1,389     $1,353	+2.7	 +1.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $9,171     $8,899	+3.1	 +1.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended     October 5.</p>
<p>    Full company name is     J.C. Penney Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Above results are for JCPenney stores only.</p>
<p>Based on the National Retail Federation calendar, which compares the same weeks as the previous year, JCPenney's September same-store sales rose 5.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
